			title: "Graphene Modulator"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1EB339EC7EEE0427", "5C32C3BBED862564", "5FBB5CC4F79C7D79"]
			description: ["A waveguide circuit with a quantum dot source, a detector, a modulator and an emitter on it is the &6Quantum Photonic Chip&r: a whole optical circuit on a few millimetres. The photonic integration hall, a circuit 2 program and one of each part above. The optical computer, which is a chip on an optical assembly. Parts by ME in matched counts; keep a few chips in stock, one per computer."]
			icon: "grindless:quantum_photonic_chip"
			id: "5F27E2F032F8C5FD"
			rewards: [{ id: "30DD83A335FE115E", type: "xp", xp: 180 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "39FB1EFE40BABA0D", item: "grindless:quantum_photonic_chip", type: "item" }]
			title: "Quantum Photonic Chip"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F27E2F032F8C5FD"]
			description: ["The &6Optical Computer&r thinks in photons and runs cold. It is the UEV circuit, and the hall is the only machine that makes it. A quantum photonic chip and an optical assembly from UHV, in the photonic integration hall. Every UEV controller after the hull, and the hatches and parts that go with them. One chip and one assembly per computer: keep a dedicated chest and never a big stock."]
			icon: "gtnn:optical_computer"
			id: "12A3828ECE0C81B8"
			rewards: [{ id: "7E3E33AFA66E575E", type: "xp", xp: 220 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7702308B9A611F05", item: "gtnn:optical_computer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Optical Computer"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["Two photons entangled over a distance let a network stay in step. A &6Quantum Repeater Node&r keeps one end of the link. The entanglement station in Earth orbit, an Eu:YSO memory crystal, quantum dots, SNSPDs and hollow-core fibre. The UEV wireless link, and the cell that the quantum repeater keeps in step. Ship the parts to orbit by ME and bring the nodes back; one node is worth a long run."]
			icon: "grindless:quantum_repeater_node"
			id: "7B8852855265F1E3"
			rewards: [{ id: "7C1CF223384BD91B", type: "xp", xp: 180 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "186E02F9F2068179", item: "grindless:quantum_repeater_node", type: "item" }]
			title: "Quantum Repeater Node"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 8.5d
		}
	]
	subtitle: ["A wafer that bends light, a chip that counts single photons, and the optical computer every UEV machine is built around."]
	title: "UEV: Circuits"
